Triangle $ACX$ is also a $30^\circ$-$60^\circ$-$90^\circ$ triangle, so the sides $CX$, $AX$, and $AC$ are in the ratio $1:\sqrt3:2$. Thus, $AX=(2\sqrt3)(\sqrt 3)=6$.

